<title>USA: S.Carolina Electric &amp; Gas files shelf for pfd shrs.</title>
<headline>S.Carolina Electric &amp; Gas files shelf for pfd shrs.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBIA, S.C. 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Carolina Electric &amp; Gas Co, a unit of SCANA Corp, said Friday it filed a shelf registration with the Securities and Exchange Commission for a $100 million offering of preferred stock.</p>
<p>The shelf is for the proposed sale of up to one million shares of its $100 par value cumulative preferred stock which it expects to offer sometime during the second quarter, the company said.</p>
<p>Terms of the sale of the preferred stock will be determined at the time of the sale, the company said.</p>
<p>PaineWebber Inc will manage the offering, the company said.</p>
</text>
